      "examData": {
        "taskContent": "**Part 2 - Writing with integrated reading comprehension**\n\n**Material 1:** short-story extract about a student facing a moral dilemma after a viral incident.  \n**Material 2:** article on gender stereotypes and public reactions on social media.  \n**Material 3:** fact sheet on multicultural Britain and online hate speech.\n\n**Tasks:**\n\n1. Analyse the dilemma in material 1 and its effect on the main character. (8 pts)\n2. Explain how material 2 links media power and gender stereotypes. (7 pts)\n3. Use material 3 to comment on diversity and conflict in a multicultural society. (5 pts)\n4. Write a blog article on how media environments influence moral judgement today. (10 pts)",
        "solutionContent": "A strong solution analyses the fictional dilemma, explains the gender and media perspective in the article, comments on the fact sheet with appropriate contextual understanding and writes a well-structured blog article on media and moral judgement.  \n**30 pts**",
        "scoring": {
          "maxPoints": 30,
